@baseUrl = http://localhost:5054

### Home: combined profile + projects (default locale)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home

### Home: combined profile + projects in English
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home?locale=en

### Home: with keyset pagination cursor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/home?cursor=2024:00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&pageSize=5

### Profile in the default locale (Russian)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile

### Profile in English
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile?locale=en

### An unsupported locale — 400, with the list of supported locales
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile?locale=de

### Published projects, in the default locale
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects

### Published projects in English
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?locale=en

### Projects with keyset pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?cursor=2024:00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&pageSize=5

### A malformed cursor — 400, not a silent restart from the first page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects?cursor=not-a-cursor

### Liveness: the process is up
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: unhealthy until the database answers
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
